/build/
*.core

# Vendored stdlib snapshot — populated by `cyrius deps` from the
# version-matched toolchain (the `cyrius = "X.Y.Z"` pin in
# cyrius.cyml). Never committed: a checked-in copy goes stale on a
# pin bump and silently shadows the matched snapshot (cycc warns
# "cwd ./lib/ shadows version-pinned …"). Matches patra / sigil.
# Run `cyrius deps` after every fresh checkout. See ADR 0018.
/lib/

# Generated by scripts/embed-grammars.sh — produced fresh on each
# build / distlib. Inlines grammars/*.cyml into the bundle so
# dist/vyakarana.cyr is self-contained for downstream `cyrius deps`
# consumers. Never committed.
/src/grammar_blobs.cyr
.claude/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
